    onto:alignmentRationale "Orbit is modeled as a domain object carrying orbital parameters, orbit type and trajectory geometry, not as a pure geometry node; it is therefore a geo:Feature whose actual path geometry can be linked via geo:hasGeometry. Orbit is not equivalent to geo:Geometry."@en ;
