        _:cb9e1fb6857b6ecd2e90a4ba625d94b83b2b735bf830a51fcf695ca9dbe4a9350ba,
        geo:Feature ;
    onto:alignmentRationale "A SpaceObject can play the SOSA FeatureOfInterest role in concrete observation contexts, but it is a domain entity type; TC-SSSAO does not globally define every space object as a FeatureOfInterest."@en,
        "SpaceObject is a domain entity with spatial location/geometry representation; as a Feature it may be linked to a geo:Geometry via geo:hasGeometry. The previous direct subPropertyOf geo:asWKT shortcut (SpaceObject -> wktLiteral) conflated Feature and Geometry and has been removed."@en ;
    onto:mappedToExternalTerm sosa:FeatureOfInterest ;
